## Phase 5: Git Commit & Push

### Step 15: Configure Git User
**Program**: Git Config
```bash
git config user.email "vr4127806@gmail.com"
git config user.name "vishuu77"
```

### Step 16: Stage All Changes
**Program**: Git Add
```bash
git add .
```

### Step 17: Commit Changes
**Program**: Git Commit
```bash
git commit -m "🏗️ Restructure: 9 clean project folders + demo videos

- Move all apps to dedicated folders: Flight_Price_Prediction/, PAN_Card_Tampering_Detection/, etc.
- Fix all hardcoded paths to relative (works on any machine)
- Add 8 demo videos: 01_watermark.mp4 through dog_breed.mp4
- Update README with project overview and quick start
- All 9 projects ready for portfolio use"
```

### Step 18: Push to GitHub
**Program**: GitHub CLI
```bash
gh repo sync  # Used due to git authentication issues
```

---

## Phase 6: Space Management

### Step 19: Analyze C: Drive Space
**Program**: System Utilities
```bash
# Check drive sizes
powershell "Get-Volume | Where-Object DriveLetter -eq 'C'"
# Result: C: 145.84 GB total, only 10 GB free (90% full)
```

### Step 20: Create D: Drive Structure
**Program**: Terminal/Mkdir
```bash
mkdir -p /d/ML_Projects/ /d/AppData/hermes_cache/
```

### Step 21: Move Large Project Folders
**Program**: Terminal/Cp
```bash
cp -r /c/Users/Admin/course_projects/04_plant_disease /d/ML_Projects/
cp -r /c/Users/Admin/course_projects/05_vehicle_detection /d/ML_Projects/
cp -r /c/Users/Admin/course_projects/06_face_swap /d/ML_Projects/
```

### Step 22: Verify Space Freed
**Program**: Terminal/Du
```bash
du -sh /d/ML_Projects/
# Result: 978MB moved to D: drive
```

